@startuml 15-deployment-diagram
title Deployment Diagram - Sistem Informasi Puskeswan

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif

node "Client Device\n(Browser Pengguna)" as ClientDevice {
  artifact "Web Browser\n(Chrome, Firefox, Edge)" as Browser
}

node "Web Server / Application Server" as AppServer {
  artifact "Aplikasi Web Puskeswan\n(Backend & Frontend Framework)" as WebApp
}

node "Database Server" as DBServer {
  database "Relational Database\n(MySQL / PostgreSQL)" as DB
}

Browser -- AppServer : HTTPS / Jaringan Internet
AppServer -- DBServer : TCP/IP (Internal Network)

note right of AppServer
  **Keterangan Deployment:**
  - Admin dan Dokter mengakses sistem melalui browser di perangkat masing-masing.
  - Seluruh logika bisnis dan validasi Autofill diproses di Application Server.
  - Data permanen (pemilik, hewan RM0001, kunjungan, dan pemeriksaan) disimpan terpusat di Database Server.
end note

@enduml
